  "notes": [
    "No release before 0.5.0 may claim any of this is balanced: every magnitude raid-engagement added carries tuningStatus untuned and the balance harness owns all of them. These gate sweeps submit no god verb and open no portal, so they cannot observe a raid at all -- which is exactly why every number here is unchanged, and is not evidence that the raid layer works. The measurement that says the raid verbs are not decoration is packages/rules-raid/test/unit/verbs.test.ts, paired over eight seeds. The reference universe also remains degenerate in the known ways W7 and W17 recorded, and this change closes none of them: it adds verbs to a layer no gate sweep reaches. What it does close is the question ui/raid asked -- a player now has something to do while a raid runs -- and that is a claim about agency rather than about balance."
